module mistake_dotdo .
rem expect: E-CLOSER-EXTRA

fn big input a u64 . output u64 .
do
  rem ko: ✘ 조건 뒤에 마침표를 하나 더 찍었다 --- 조건은 제 점으로 이미 닫혔고, 그 다음은 `do` 다 /// en: ✘ one stop too many after the condition --- the condition is already closed by its own stop, and `do` comes next
  if gt a. 3 . . do
    return 1 .
  end .
  return 0 .
end .
